      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAY IT FORWARD (8) can keep up the top recent form following a sharp 17.58 win two back with a Grade 5 victory at Bulli over 400m in 22.30. Running fast times and looks the one to beat again. MR. CHILLI (7) filled the minor placings two races on end before breaking through for a maiden win last time, scoring by 0.8 lengths (17.79) at this track. Must be included in calculations. KID KERMARO (2) was impressive last time, posting an effortless 3.5 lengths win in taking a Grade 5 in 17.54 and a new Best time this course and distance. Should be in this for a long way. CARDIAC RHYTHM (1) has ability and finds the right scenario to bounce back. Something for the Multiples: MR. CHILLI (7)",
